Why have I never heard
Dana's name before?

475
00:23:41,643 --> 00:23:44,826
Because it was 1990
and you were dating Jack Wagner.

476
00:23:46,881 --> 00:23:48,130
I don't think I could live

477
00:23:48,250 --> 00:23:50,924
with having someone work for you
that you had sex with.

478
00:23:51,222 --> 00:23:52,792
Could you live with that?

479
00:23:57,916 --> 00:23:59,841
- Is Vince coming with us?
- What?

480
00:23:59,961 --> 00:24:02,553
Jesus Christ,
what the fuck is he doing here?

481
00:24:11,120 --> 00:24:13,840
- Look at this power couple.
- Hey, there he is.

482
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:15,657
Good to see you, sir.
How are you?

483
00:24:15,777 --> 00:24:17,344
- Hello, John.
- You look beautiful.

484
00:24:17,464 --> 00:24:19,813
Thank you for the lovely vacation.
Kate, hi.

485
00:24:20,132 --> 00:24:21,562
- Shall we?
- Yes, we shall.

486
00:24:22,753 --> 00:24:25,060
- Can you just give me one quick second?
- Sure.

487
00:24:29,305 --> 00:24:31,146
- Small world?
- What are you doing here?

488
00:24:31,266 --> 00:24:34,113
- Listen, we are taking a little trip.
- Yeah, us too.

489
00:24:34,577 --> 00:24:36,893
I can see that you're saving money
by flying private again.

490
00:24:37,013 --> 00:24:38,380
Not our dime.
It's theirs.

491
00:24:40,831 --> 00:24:41,935
Nice dime.

492
00:24:42,457 --> 00:24:44,052
- Where are you headed?
- To Geneva.

493
00:24:44,212 --> 00:24:45,820
That's Alan's boss right there.

494
00:24:47,090 --> 00:24:49,062
You're going to Geneva for me?

495
00:24:51,458 --> 00:24:53,762
- Something wrong?
- Yeah, listen, Vinnie.

496
00:24:53,882 --> 00:24:56,846
You're the only one in this town
that I'm telling this to.

497
00:24:56,966 --> 00:24:59,747
I'm in a position to get you
any job that we want

498
00:24:59,867 --> 00:25:01,696
for the rest of your career.

499
00:25:02,277 --> 00:25:03,304
How so?

500
00:25:03,424 --> 00:25:06,617
They're offering me Alan's position.
They want me to run the studio.

501
00:25:08,895 --> 00:25:11,004
It just came out of the blue.
What do you think?

502
00:25:11,698 --> 00:25:13,149
I just--
I mean I--

503
00:25:13,668 --> 00:25:16,251
I think I'd like us to finish
what we started together,

504
00:25:17,537 --> 00:25:19,971
but I think you gotta do
what you gotta do, right?

505
00:25:20,091 --> 00:25:21,489
What are you thinking?

506
00:25:22,067 --> 00:25:23,432
I'm thinking...

507
00:25:25,179 --> 00:25:27,601
I don't know.
I'm thinking. I'm thinking.

508
00:25:28,465 --> 00:25:29,931
I'll tell you that much.

509
00:25:36,222 --> 00:25:37,990
- Have a good trip.
- You too.

510
00:25:38,349 --> 00:25:39,415
All right.

511
00:25:45,831 --> 00:25:46,849
What's up?

512
00:25:47,775 --> 00:25:49,951
They just offered Ari
the studio head position.

513
00:25:50,071 --> 00:25:51,286
Is he gonna take it?

514
00:25:56,208 --> 00:25:57,486
What's up, bro?

515
00:26:01,581 --> 00:26:03,907
I figure we could just
pick up where we left off.

516
00:26:05,578 --> 00:26:07,506
There are more girls coming, right?

517
00:26:07,626 --> 00:26:10,055
- Don't worry. Any second.
- They better be good looking.

518
00:26:12,336 --> 00:26:15,564
You're so lucky. I get so claustrophobic
and cramped on these flights.

519
00:26:15,684 --> 00:26:17,341
- Will you stop it, Raina?
- What?

520
00:26:17,461 --> 00:26:19,347
Because I'm not that small,
that's why.

521
00:26:19,467 --> 00:26:21,602
Did I hurt your feelings?
I'm just teasing you.

522
00:26:21,722 --> 00:26:23,718
It's not a very smart way
to get a manager.

523
00:26:23,838 --> 00:26:25,227
I want a manager.

524
00:26:25,534 --> 00:26:27,267
But I need a spinner.

525
00:26:28,483 --> 00:26:30,434
Did she just call him a spinner?

526
00:26:32,580 --> 00:26:33,828
Hello, ladies.

527
00:26:33,988 --> 00:26:35,527
Hey, now we're talking.

528
00:26:36,902 --> 00:26:38,851
Hey, how are you?
Who needs a drink?

529
00:26:39,065 --> 00:26:40,083
Drinks?

530
00:26:41,996 --> 00:26:45,508
So who's ready
for five hours of captivity?

531
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:48,573
Drinks all around?

532
00:26:50,753 --> 00:26:52,447
Are you all right, Vince?

533
00:26:52,567 --> 00:26:54,132
How could I be better?

